    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nOn sites that restrict whispers to specific groups, moderators who are not members of any group in `whispers_allowed_groups` could read deleted whispers through a user's deleted posts list. \r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nNo known workarounds that keep whispers hidden from moderators. Sites that intend moderators to see whispers can add them to a group in `whispers_allowed_groups`.\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-0EQDJQOX.",
